menu "Tab5 OS console"

    config T5_DIAG_BENCH
        bool "Phase 0 bench commands (elf, gpio, sleep)"
        default n
        help
            The bring-up benchmarks: `elf bench` (bench check 11; embeds a
            61 KB test ELF and the same kernels built in), `gpio watch|get`
            and `sleep light|result` (bench 0.6-0.8). Their results are in
            docs/bench-results.md. Off in normal builds: about 120 KB of
            flash that nothing else uses. Turn on to re-run those checks.

endmenu
